sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
`repeat()` avoids duplicating the same track value. `repeat(2, 1fr)` creates two equal fractional columns and is easier to maintain than writing the same track twice.

**Worked example:**

```css
main {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
}
```

**Line by line:** `main {` continues the existing Grid rule. `grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);` asks Grid to create two copies of a `1fr` column track, so the two columns share available space equally. The closing `}` completes the rule.

